mage rows","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1001301.webp?v=23d48e68f353"},{"id":1001302,"type":2,"typeName":"共鸣技能","typeNameEn":"Resonance Skill","name":"盛放与凋零的轮舞","nameEn":"Valse of Bloom and Blight","maxLevel":10,"desc":"红椿盛绽\n攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害，并进入盛绽状态，此次伤害为普攻伤害。\n可在空中施放。\n \n盛绽状态\n·椿缠绕藤蔓期间无法移动；\n·普攻和重击修枝替换为普攻蔓舞，进行最多4段的连续攻击，造成湮灭伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害;\n·施放普攻第3段蔓舞时，长按普攻，将会施放普攻烬华蔓舞，造成湮灭伤害，并自动施放普攻第4段蔓舞;\n·闪避反击替换为闪避反击偿赎，成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害；\n·共鸣技能替换为共鸣技能黯蕊猎心，施放黯蕊猎心时，将会攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害；\n·可在空中施放共鸣技能黯蕊猎心；\n·施放共鸣技能黯蕊猎心后，将会退出盛绽状态;\n·施放控物时，将会退出盛绽状态；\n·跳跃替换为普攻旋舞，短按跳跃，将会消耗耐力攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害，并退出盛绽状态；\n·在空中施放普攻蔓舞、普攻烬华蔓舞，将会消耗耐力；\n·施放共鸣技能黯蕊猎心时，无法回复耐力；\n·在空中缠绕藤蔓期间，持续消耗耐力。","descEn":"Crimson Blossom\nAttack the target, dealing Havoc DMG (considered Basic Attack DMG), then enter Blossom Mode.\nThis attack can be performed in mid-air.\n \nBlossom Mode\n- Unable to move while suspended on vines.\n- Basic Attack and Heavy Attack Pruning are replaced by Basic Attack Vining Waltz: chain together 4 consecutive attacks, dealing Havoc DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- When performing Vining Waltz Stage 3, hold Normal Attack Button to cast Blazing Waltz that deals Havoc DMG before automatically performing Vining Waltz Stage 4.\n- Dodge Counter is replaced by Dodge Counter Atonement. Tap Normal Attack Button right after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Havoc DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Resonance Skill is replaced by Resonance Skill Floral Ravage. Casting Floral Ravage deals Havoc DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Resonance Skill Floral Ravage can be cast in mid-air.\n- Blossom Mode ends after casting Resonance Skill Floral Ravage.\n- Blossom Mode ends after using the Levitator.\n- Jump is replaced with Basic Attack Vining Ronde. Use Jump to attack the target at the cost of STA, dealing Havoc DMG (considered Basic Attack DMG). This ends the Blossom Mode.\n- Using Basic Attack Vining Waltz and Basic Attack Blazing Waltz in mid-air consumes STA.\n- Casting Resonance Skill Floral Ravage doesn't restore STA.\n- Consume STA continuously to stay suspended on the vines.","params":[{"label":"红椿盛绽伤害","labelEn":"Crimson Blossom DMG","values":["57.15%*2","61.84%*2","66.53%*2","73.09%*2","77.77%*2","83.16%*2","90.66%*2","98.16%*2","105.66%*2","113.62%*2"]},{"label":"蔓舞第一段伤害","labelEn":"Vining Waltz 1 DMG","values":["48.45%","52.43%","56.40%","61.96%","65.94%","70.50%","76.86%","83.22%","89.57%","96.33%"]},{"label":"蔓舞第二段伤害","labelEn":"Vining Waltz 2 DMG","values":["22.95%*2","24.84%*2","26.72%*2","29.35%*2","31.24%*2","33.40%*2","36.41%*2","39.42%*2","42.43%*2","45.63%*2"]},{"label":"蔓舞第三段伤害","labelEn":"Vining Waltz 3 DMG","values":["11.04%*6","11.95%*6","12.86%*6","14.12%*6","15.03%*6","16.07%*6","17.52%*6","18.97%*6","20.41%*6","21.95%*6"]},{"label":"蔓舞第四段伤害","labelEn":"Vining Waltz 4 DMG","values":["34.00%*3","36.79%*3","39.58%*3","43.48%*3","46.27%*3","49.47%*3","53.93%*3","58.39%*3","62.85%*3","67.59%*3"]},{"label":"烬华蔓舞伤害","labelEn":"Blazing Waltz DMG","values":["11.04%*19","11.95%*19","12.86%*19","14.12%*19","15.03%*19","16.07%*19","17.52%*19","18.97%*19","20.41%*19","21.95%*19"]},{"label":"黯蕊猎心伤害","labelEn":"Floral Ravage DMG","values":["26.46%*5","28.63%*5","30.80%*5","33.84%*5","36.01%*5","38.51%*5","41.98%*5","45.45%*5","48.92%*5","52.61%*5"]},{"label":"旋舞伤害","labelEn":"Vining Ronde DMG","values":["26.64%*3","28.82%*3","31.00%*3","34.06%*3","36.24%*3","38.76%*3","42.25%*3","45.74%*3","49.24%*3","52.95%*3"]},{"label":"偿赎伤害","labelEn":"Atonement DMG","values":["57.00%*2","61.68%*2","66.35%*2","72.90%*2","77.57%*2","82.95%*2","90.42%*2","97.90%*2","105.38%*2","113.33%*2"]},{"label":"冷却时间","labelEn":"Cooldown","values":["4","4","4","4","4","4","4","4","4","4"]},{"label":"红椿盛绽回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Crimson Blossom Concerto Regen","values":["7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7"]},{"label":"黯蕊猎心回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Floral Ravage Concerto Regen","values":["7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7","7"]},{"label":"蔓舞第一段耐力消耗","labelEn":"